# 行尾规范化：仓库内一律 LF，检出也 LF
# （本机系统级 gitconfig 为 core.autocrlf=true，若不强制，重新 clone 后
#   *.sh / Makefile 会被转成 CRLF，WSL 里直接跑不了——2026-09-10 加固）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，不做任何行尾/编码转换
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.gz binary
*.mcs binary
*.bit binary
*.ltx binary
*.xci binary
